  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>At Goldie Links, we believe jewelry should mean something.</strong></p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">We create customized, intention-driven jewelry that tells stories — not just trends. Every piece is handmade by our tribe of local stay-at-home and working moms using high-quality 14k gold fill, sterling silver, and stainless steel — metals designed to last. We use genuine gemstones (including our best-selling opalite) and specialize in hidden messages, Morse code, birthstones, and engraved jewelry.</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><em>This is jewelry that’s more than pretty.<br>It represents the things that matter most.</em></p><h3 style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">What Makes Goldie Links Different</h3><ul style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><li><p>✨ Handmade by real moms in our community</p></li><li><p>✨ High-quality, tarnish-resistant metals</p></li><li><p>✨ Genuine gemstones + meaningful properties</p></li><li><p>✨ Hidden message &amp; Morse code designs</p></li><li><p>✨ Custom engraving options</p></li><li><p>✨ Jewelry designed with intention, connection, and story</p></li></ul><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>We don’t mass produce. We create with meaning.</strong></p><hr style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><h2 style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">How You Earn</h2><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">As a Goldie Links Affiliate, you’ll earn a commission on every sale made through your unique link or code.</p><ul style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><li><p>💰 Earn<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"><strong> 10</strong></span><strong>% commission</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>on all qualifying retail sales</p></li><li><p>🎁 Early access to launches and limited collections</p></li><li><p>📦 Priority updates on new drops (like opal hearts, Word of the Year pieces, and custom collections)</p></li></ul><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>The more you share, the more you earn — while supporting a women-led, mama-made business.</strong></p><hr style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><h2 style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">How to Promote Goldie Links</h2><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Sharing Goldie Links is simple and authentic — just like our brand.</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">You can promote by:</p><ul style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><li><p>Posting styled photos of your favorite pieces</p></li><li><p>Sharing the meaning behind your Morse code or hidden message bracelet</p></li><li><p>Creating Reels showing how you stack your jewelry</p></li><li><p>Talking about gemstone properties and intention</p></li><li><p>Sharing your personal story of what your piece represents</p></li><li><p>Adding your affiliate link to your bio, stories, emails, or website</p></li></ul><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>The best promotion? Real stories.<br></strong>When you share why your piece matters to you, others connect.</p><hr style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Goldie Links is more than jewelry.<br>It’s energy. It’s story. It’s community.</p><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><em><strong>And now you get to be part of spreading that magic. ✨</strong></em></p></div>",
